 "lines": {"koi_net_leaves": ["Leaves out. Pond looks smug about it.", "Fished out a lot of leaves. Zero fish. Fine."], "koi_draw_a_weed_off_the_fin": ["Weed off. Koi blinked. Gratitude, I think.", "You had a salad on your fin. Hold still."], "koi_hand_feed_the_hungriest": ["Took it right out of my bill. Eight out of ten, rude.", "Hand-fed a koi. Trust me. Mostly its."], "koi_let_the_shy_one_kiss_his_bill": ["Fish lips. Very wet. Ten out of ten.", "It kissed me and left. Story of my life."], "koi_walk_the_rim_with_a_wing_trailing": ["It followed me the whole length. Nobody else does.", "Led a fish on a wing. I am a very small parade."], "koi_race_the_koi_along_the_rim": ["Lost by a fin. Rigged. Fish cut corners.", "Race over. The koi wasn't even trying."], "koi_blow_bubbles_at_the_surface": ["Bubble conversation. Mostly it won.", "Blub. Blub. It said blub. Excellent."], "koi_duck_into_the_reeds_and_pop_out_at_it": ["Boo. The koi did not jump. It yawned.", "Hide and seek. It lost, then won, then left."], "koi_watch_the_shadow_glide_in": ["A big orange shadow. Mine now, spiritually.", "Looks like a coin with ambitions."], "koi_taste_a_sip_of_the_pond": ["Pond. Regrettable. A little koi, a lot of algae.", "Tastes like a wet lawn. I am not sure why I did it."], "koi_squint_at_two_reflections": ["I have the better bill. It has the better coat.", "Two pretty faces. One of them is mine."], "koi_wait_for_a_koi_to_rise": ["Come up. Say hello. No? Fine.", "Waited. It rose. It looked. I won."], "koi_chip_the_ice_skin_at_the_rim": ["Hole made. Fish can breathe. You are welcome, fish.", "Ice cracked. Ice complained."], "koi_argue_with_the_koi_over_the_flakes": ["It ate it. I said it was mine. It heard nothing.", "Argued with a fish. Lost on volume."], "koi_sing_the_koi_a_slow_song": ["It listens. It hasn't left. That is a review.", "A love song for a fish. I would do it again."], "koi_bill_caught_in_a_koi_s_hungry_mouth": ["It has a mouth like a hoover. Bill: stuck. Dignity: gone.", "Let go! It did. Eventually. Hostile fish."], "koi_leap_back_from_a_sudden_splash": ["It attacked. A fish. It attacked me.", "Splashed. Jumped. Pretended I meant to."], "koi_herd_the_koi_from_both_ends_of_the_rim": ["Pincer movement. Koi slipped away. Embarrassing.", "We herded one fish for ten minutes. We won."]},
